  "title": "Are you seeing the Pillars as they are now?",
  "logline": "Gus thinks the Webb photo shows the Pillars of Creation today. Vera works out how old the light is.",
  "description": "The light in Webb's Pillars of Creation image left the nebula about 6,500 years ago. Image: NASA, ESA, CSA, STScI (CC BY 4.0). Sources and simplifications in the pinned comment.",
